# Final Intelligence Refinement (MVP)

**SoT:** [`docs/02-product/solenos-final-intelligence-refinement.md`](../../docs/02-product/solenos-final-intelligence-refinement.md)

## Priority

Improve Care Reality **understanding** before UI. Moat = baseline → change → context → decision → outcome — not timeline screens.

## Target feel

*Organized care reality* — never *AI summarized my note* / reflective echo.

## Must

- Prefer baseline change over isolated events  
- Separate Observed · Interpretation · Concern  
- Preserve multiple perspectives (no winner)  
- Specific What matters now (ban empty “Stay with what is already held” when facts exist)  
- Unknowns as care reality; never false confidence / diagnosis  
- Examples in docs = illustrations only — never templates  

## Never

Chatbot empathy · generic healthcare articles · task-ifying caregiver load · hardcoding scenario nouns
